[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0010","text":"咦，Producer，镜头在拍吗？\n——啊，在拍呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0020","text":"那么小恋酱，\n能请你告诉我们接下来拍摄的概念吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0030","text":"嗯～是什么呢～\n《恋爱的妖精们爱玩耍！》"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0040","text":"好——，就是这样。那么——\n五位妖精，现在要坐上加长礼车出发啦——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0050","text":"那就立刻出发前进吧\nProducer也请坐上来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0060","text":"……大家——？想拍的画面，\n是《玩惯了的小恶魔们的从容》《酷》哦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0070","text":"《酷》啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0080","text":"——啊，对了，模仿咲耶吧～！\n呐，这样感觉行不行？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0090","text":"嗯？　是啊——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0100","text":"来了来了，托下巴"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0110","text":"哇……恋钟酱，咲耶小姐……\n好帅……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0120","text":"来吧，妖精们的派对正酣\n是时候把我们的最佳状态烙印在镜头里了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0016","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0130","text":"啊哈哈，这可不能不跟着来呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0140","text":"《可爱的风啊，可爱的风》"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0150","text":"《你是多么调皮》"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0160","text":"《你是多么任性》"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0170","text":"《多么善变啊》"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0180","text":"《在长啼鸟啼鸣之前》"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0190","text":"《且歌且舞，抚慰我胸》"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_05_0200","text":"《慰藉的风啊，慰藉的风》"}]
